  "summary": "Repair the corrupted prohibition field of D131 (Xingcheng special law, autonomous training and upgrade). The stored value interleaves a '|' between every character and drops all spaces; the restored text is the literal decode with word boundaries reinserted: no direct overwrite of current weights or programs; no self-issued release authority; no third-party weights mixed into the chain; no candidate activation without independent verification and a rollback path; any failure fails closed and leaves the active weights, runtime checkpoint and adapter registry untouched. The corruption also propagates to the codex_search_document projection, which the build step regenerates.",
