      "proposed": "FORBID:No direct overwrite of current weights or programs; no self-issued release authority; no third-party weights mixed into the chain; no candidate activation without independent verification and a rollback path; any failure fails closed and leaves the active weights, runtime checkpoint and adapter registry untouched."
